'''Scissoroo''' (ハサミーマン, ''Hasamīman'', '''Scissorman''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Kang Roo]] introduced in [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2. She was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]].

