==Enemy==
Uses the scissor-like pincers on her hands to fire lethal Area Attacks from 199 range, or 1 less than [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]]. However, she has a longer backswing compared to other variants, making it difficult for her to advance, and lacks multi-hit. Groups of Scissoroos can push hard, but the [[Cat Cannon]] is enough to sync them up. Be careful with your timing against Scissoroo with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], as he is likely to speed clip past his 1 range advantage, basically dying instantly in some cases.

