==Trivia==
*She is a reference to [[wikia:ultra:Alien Baltan|Alien Baltan]], a lobster-ish alien with similar metal pincers from the ''Ultraman'' franchise. Scissoroo uses blasters hidden inside her pincers to attack, just like how Alien Baltans have various hidden weapons inside their pincers.
*Her name may also be a reference to the Tim Burton movie ''[[wikipedia:Edward Scissorhands|Edward Scissorhands]]''.
*[[wikipedia:Gliese 832 c|Gliese 832 c]] was a a planet that was once believed to be real, but its existence was refuted in 2022.
*The "SBA" in her Japanese description is a reference to the [[wikipedia:World Boxing Association|World Boxing Association (WBA)]], with the "S" presumably standing for Space.
*She was the only [[Kang Roo]] variant to not receive multi-hit in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].
*If Scissoroo advances a little at a time, it will look like she is sliding. This is due to the fact that her walking animation starts on the ground longer than other Kang Roo variants.

